;
; dungeon_c.tres — Deep dungeon variant C.
; Cross-shaped crypt with four corner alcoves; diamond_ore at intersection, iron veins.
; Palette: stone/cobble natural, iron_ore/diamond_ore natural, dark-grey (2) floor inlays.
; Contains bronze chest (centre) + regular chest (north alcove).
; DOCS.md §2 — dungeon structure; CONTEXT.md D-08 (rare, deep underground).
; allowed_biomes = [] means any biome — placement gated by depth in structure_placer.

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://src/bricks/brick_template.gd" id="1_btmpl"]

